{"server":"tw","storyId":"act17side_level_act17side_st08","groupId":"act17side","stageId":"act17side_08","title":"指揮大廳","storyCode":"SN-ST-8","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_st08.txt","sourceHash":"1d3a68b4e3817379823cc758a8b9142836e154bb5709d79c2ba0715248cc3520","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g23_goldenboat_pass"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他引我來到這裡，隨後隱去了氣味。看來他在陸地上學會了不少手段。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂婭環顧四周。\n她知道，有一個曾經的友人就在這附近盯著她。\n但她沒有猶豫，也沒有時間猶豫。她必須儘快得到關於這艘船的全部秘密，她必須......帶著這些秘密，重回阿戈爾。\n她想回到家園。她想幫助自己的家園，對抗災禍。\n歌蕾蒂婭看著手裡的鑰匙。\n她打開了寶庫的大門。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g16_lighthouse_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"焚燒這些溟痕很費功夫，我真該謝謝凱爾希和那隻漆黑的生物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溟痕吞噬不掉這片礁石。很遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這也只是萬千形態中的一種，你沒有聽過預言，你不會理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"預言？不過是未知生物的信徒，一群逃避者，難道還需要未來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先知與你們不同。她從不描述虛偽的未來，從不做無法實踐的許諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她只說，只說千萬片巨鱗將匯成一體，飛向深空。只說大海將被光芒塗抹，此消彼長，永不乾涸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只說生命的死亡和消逝都將融為一體，屆時，連這片虛假的群星都遮蔽不住生命的光芒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們將生存在那樣一個生態中。我們皆是壯美循環的一部分。生命誕生，生命奉獻，生命尋求價值，生命消逝，周而復始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽上去，不過是某種源石技藝給你們看到的幻覺罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將伊比利亞逼到如此境地，數百萬生靈塗炭，這也是壯美循環的一部分嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你理解什麼？！族群從不將個體的死當做“結束”，生命在結束後仍屬於壯美循環的一部分！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你憤怒，你焦躁，你還只是個人類啊，異端。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不會被你抓住，審判官。我知道你的源石技藝，可恨的法術。我們都做好了奉獻的準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你將永遠無法觸及先知，就像你抓不住時間，時間從你的指尖流逝！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大審判官！格蘭法洛的所有人都對你們積怨已久！懲戒軍靠近不了這裡，現在你孤身一人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古怪的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你逃不掉的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......逃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在這裡，難道是為了費口舌爭辯，正義與邪惡的嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊......哈啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"負責拷問的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他什麼都不說，愚蠢的伊比利亞人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"負責拷問的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那隻黑色怪物一定有弱點，它堅硬無比，還能輕易燒毀溟痕......它究竟是什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"負責拷問的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果再不得到些情報，等懲戒軍突破了包圍網，我們就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——就失敗了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......就憑你們是對付不了凱爾希醫生和那位審判官閣下的。你們已經輸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"負責拷問的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"住口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"負責拷問的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要把你——等等，你在做什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"負責拷問的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的杖為什麼有動靜！？你做了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們似乎太關注你們的海洋動物了......哦，你們是不是都不懂什麼叫“源石技藝”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太脫離現實生活可不好——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"負責拷問的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自以為是的傢伙——！你以為我們什麼都沒準備？為了把你們這些和審判庭同流合污的人一網打盡，我們籌備了多久！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別相信他的故弄玄虛，他在這個小鎮躲藏了幾個月，他是個間諜，精通通訊手段的間諜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許我們的位置已經暴露了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"負責拷問的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......間諜，間諜，我們之中一定早就潛伏了審判庭的間諜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你們的存在，是因為你們不加掩飾，我和阿瑪雅走得很近。但審判庭不同，他們確實懷著惡意對待格蘭法洛，如果他們想藏......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們畢竟只是世代為工的工人，我們怎麼發現呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"負責拷問的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就把他丟出去餵給同胞們吧。溟痕蔓延的速度在減緩，我們需要更多養分，阻攔懲戒軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"負責拷問的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，我們也應當想辦法離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。我來帶路，沒有人比我更熟悉格蘭法洛，過去我們留下了不少暗道和地下倉庫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亞戈，你不該這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們才認識多久？你來教我怎麼做，空喊口號的衛道士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站起來，走，你會變成海的一部分。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g25_goldenboat_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（原來如此。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（源石能源與阿戈爾科技的結合，更堅固的穹頂，陸地移動城市的應用模式，源石技藝的拓展性。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這就是科學院的天才眼中的大地。幾十年時間，足夠他做到這些......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（但是......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是還不夠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i35"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"即使不依靠與陸地的交流，阿戈爾依然能做到。些微技術融合，成為不了反敗為勝的關鍵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"果然......是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這不是一件好事，烏爾比安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"站穩了，你若是多走一步，我會貫穿你，我曾經的戰友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂一度認為，深海獵人只剩她最後一人。連她都覺得你死了，你卻還活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你很敏銳，執政官歌蕾蒂婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這種場合似乎沒必要在意繁文縟節，執政官烏爾比安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很久沒聽人這麼稱呼你，感到懷念了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們相識很久了。沒有歸隊的獵人意味著什麼，你最清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我處決的人不比你少。而我現在依然可以保證，如果倖存者中有人墮入深淵，我會在他們聽見那歌聲前，把他們懸掛在乾燥的礁石上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼現在呢？你身上有它們的氣味，你與它們同流合污。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別騙自己。歌蕾蒂婭，你對他人嚴厲，但你對自己更甚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"難道在陸地上徘徊，已經讓你享受上折磨自己的感覺了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"獵人，如果你的回答不讓我滿意，我會殺死你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"歌蕾蒂婭，大部分事情在脫離你的掌控，我必須從另一個角度解決問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......和你們一樣。在陸地上生活了一小段時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我看見了些別的東西。你理解陸上文明了嗎？不，你不用回答，傲慢的歌蕾蒂婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"陸地文明為了生存，開發源石。源石帶給他們機遇與希望，也帶給他們新的災難，時至今日，他們仍舊無法徹底解析源石的原理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看過很多慘劇......他們稱之為“天災”。他們愚昧，無知，弱小，可他們的滅亡與掙扎依舊觸目驚心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......阿戈爾，與他們毫無區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你過去不是個軟弱的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不。我不是在談論感性的話題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是說，阿戈爾為了生存而驚動了海洋，海洋吞噬阿戈爾，然後又誕生了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們是畸形鬥爭的產物。我們不能從源頭解決問題，我們就無法解決問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你看到了什麼？烏爾比安。你看到了什麼，讓你放棄血的饋贈，放棄我們並肩作戰的情誼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“神殿”。如果是那些令人作嘔的教徒，他們一定會如此稱呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你對他們的熟絡只會削減我對你的信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但這個詞，很貼切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你知道阿戈爾曾經在海洋深處發現過什麼。即使你不是專業的歷史學家，通識教育也該涉及這一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"數千年前，我們抵達海洋的中心。在那裡，我們發現了原點。文明的原點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......據我所知，歌蕾蒂婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在祂......和那些海嗣的巢穴的最深處......最深處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看見了，“建築”，不，即使請來阿戈爾最偉大的科學執政官，他們也無法解釋我所見到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我無法深入，我受傷太重。沸騰的血液，震耳欲聾的雜訊，但我還是感到了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——那裡有複數的祂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼......這似乎，不成為你離隊的理由。你更該帶回這一情報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"千萬哀嚎歸於一點的時候，那些尚未出生的海嗣，它們在形態各異的胚胎中低吟著同一個名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......Ishar-mla。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或者說，斯卡蒂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g21_goldenboat_deck"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......跳進海裡了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它還會上來，我們再等一會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，誰讓我們是它的“同族”呢，真可憐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。我看見了，浪頭在不自然地粉碎，它就像旋風或是海市蜃樓一樣，多不自然的奇觀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啐，今天真是熱鬧啊。自從小傑米和廚子死後，再沒這麼熱鬧過了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"石榴......花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......騎士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為還會有一些時日見不到你。你重來我的船上，難道是貪戀家鄉的氣味嗎？你還沒徹底瘋掉嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"騎士只是默默盯著阿方索。\n但很快，他把目光放回了海洋。阿方索隨之望去，在時間越來越模糊的歲月裡，日月已經失去意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還在狩獵巨浪嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願這些怪物的血還沒有讓你得到永生。這樣你總有一天會迎接溺亡，溺亡是幸福的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天......風不大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......浪濤，是海洋的，呼吸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它還沒有，停止呼吸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒有，死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像，地上的，怪物。吞食，毀滅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地上的怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"文明！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g23_goldenboat_pass"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我又想起來一些事情。我們......是怎麼活下來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又是怎麼活下來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"記不清細節了，我們砍殺，無休止地砍殺，然後祂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是說，呃，如果那時候，它們的整個族群要我們死，我們能活下來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"換言之，阿戈爾也不知道我們活下來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"他們沒辦法知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是劍魚說要來這艘船的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"是。她說這艘船有辦法帶我們回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，這像是阿戈爾的工藝，造船師.....布雷奧甘，沒印象的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......過去你也不記那些科學院的人名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不也是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......能這樣和你說話，我安心許多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的回來了，勞倫緹娜，你不會再離我們而去了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，有必要說這麼肉麻嗎？我以前也和你們在一起，只是稍微迷糊了一點，扮一扮乖巧的修女，我也挺喜歡那樣的感覺的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，不過這一身是隊長讓羅德島的朋友們幫我訂做的？她竟然知道具體的尺寸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......實際上，你甚至還長高了一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我只是幫了忙。二隊長說她信不過陸上人的品味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"品味？呵呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我們都知道她本人並不在意這些事情。謝謝她在這樣的細節上總是這麼到位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"她說你喜歡長裙，以前就是，我也有印象。不過......我很少做這種......裁縫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，這些符號，這些阿戈爾文字，我們一起寫上去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寫著你的事情，歌蕾蒂婭的事情，我的事情。寫著我們的阿戈爾，寫著......我們的家鄉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是誰的主意？總不會是我自己的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我們三個人的主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那款式呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......劍魚挑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難為她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得專注於戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，但是我也沒有放棄過在狩獵前整理儀容，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂，你知道當我從一片混沌中想起自己是誰的時候，第一件想到的事情是什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是重新審視當下的自己，和那個遙遠的、清晰記憶的彼岸的自己，有多大差別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然上一次當一個乖乖修女，我不算討厭——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可現在這樣由值得信任的同胞來決定的模樣，更得我心。你能明白我的心情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......肯定比你在鹽風城的那個罐子裡清醒過來時要好不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，說得對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，現在，我們要說服我們的船長先生，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交給我吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g25_goldenboat_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不可能。不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當我隨著巨物的屍骸沉入海溝，在尋常阿戈爾人都無法承受的壓力之中，我看見了以前從未見過之物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歌蕾蒂婭，你知道阿戈爾為什麼與陸地絕緣。你知道源石、天災無法侵襲阿戈爾的種種推論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們大多被證明是正確的。海洋就像一個培養皿，養育，並呵護著阿戈爾的純潔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......如果我們引以為傲的文明，才是附著於某些巨物之上的黴菌呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你過去就善於質疑，這讓你在諸多領域都有所建樹，開創性的建樹。但汙衊阿戈爾？你變得太多，我都認不出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，話題不該扯那麼遠。你對斯卡蒂的猜測......你對你自己的獵人，給出了最殘酷的指控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“海嗣”只是一個籠統的命名。你知道，它們的生命形式更加複雜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是沒有擔心過，斯卡蒂也許會成為其中更高級的那一個，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我擔心你先選錯了道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一隊，四隊，死在了途中，一頭一尾，為我們創造了突破的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，二隊，留在巢穴附近。那很難用“巢穴”描述，我們彷彿進入了一個巨大的整體，我們是渺小的病菌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但病菌也能殺死一個健康的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我們成功了。我們自以為成功了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是，與祂的屍骸一同沉眠。血，如果那發光的流體是血的話，灑滿我全身，將我包裹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我只是與祂的屍體一起睡了個好覺。我躲藏在祂的空殼中，靠著祂殘留的血肉，直到周圍的聲音全都平靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那斯卡蒂呢？是她戰鬥到最後一刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是一次正常的“殺死”。那不是“捕食”。那是一次“餵食”，族群的餵食。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的猜測正確也謬誤。你以為所有深海獵人都會失控，變成海嗣？不。斯卡蒂不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經明白了。直面過祂，在那條海溝裡沉淪浮起的我們，都明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生任何問題，我們就得殺死她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是你的獵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，甚至沒有為你刻意的隱瞞和背叛做出解釋。你卻要我相信你的猜測？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不喜歡你保持沉默的習慣。也許我需要奪走你的行動能力，將你帶回阿戈爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，終於有一位執政官在抗爭中墮落，這也許會損害士氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你做不到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歌蕾蒂婭。在你為自己的變化而焦慮的時候，你還要號稱自己代表阿戈爾嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是一個機會。我不奢求你的理解與幫助，但我們中總有人得抓住這個機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"揭開真相，才有活路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這與你現在的行為有何聯繫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你來找船，我來找布雷奧甘，那個阿戈爾人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經有所突破，布雷奧甘的證據佐證了我所見的。他很了不起。在那個年份，在那個條件下，得出了與我無異的結論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你手邊的那些——你已經明白了，那些才是真正有價值的東西。陸地上不會有人理解，所以他死去得孤獨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"並非完全沒有人理解。但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“但是”。堅定如你，強勢如你，說過幾次“但是”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是同僚，我們共同設計了這場戰爭，我們該更相互信賴一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後勸你，別回阿戈爾，還太早，太危險。我們還有很多事情沒有弄清楚，回去也是徒勞，你也不知道阿戈爾究竟變成了什麼樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留在陸地上。真有什麼意外，你說得對——她是我的獵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會承擔責任。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂婭還想說些什麼。\n但轉頭間，巨大的裂響傳遍了房間的每個角落，隨之而來的是猛烈的晃動，那滿桌的真理撒落在地上，在歌蕾蒂婭眼中顯得格外燙眼。\n“海神”。\n在總戰爭設計師們提出深海獵人這一計畫前，在深海獵人奔赴巢穴前，布雷奧甘選用了如今陸上的愚信徒們才會癡迷的稱呼。\n他想將災難的本源研究透徹。他在陸地上找到了最後一塊拼圖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......鑰匙......我......小麥的氣息......家園？家園支援我。家人支援我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到我，粉碎大海。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩個獵人看向沉吟的騎士。\n歌蕾蒂婭握緊了手裡的鑰匙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就看看這個怪物，仔細看看。似人非人，連族群都不接納他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"日復一日地尋找巨浪，擊碎巨浪，永無止境，徒勞無功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和我們一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
